   "": {
    "actClause": "AN ACT to amend the vehicle and traffic law, in relation to making technical\ncorrections to such law",
    "basePrintNo": "S8272",
    "basePrintNoStr": "S8272-2021",
    "coSponsors": {
     "items": [],
     "size": 0
    },
    "fullText": "",
    "fullTextFormats": [],
    "fullTextHtml": "",
    "fullTextTemplate": "",
    "lawCode": "Amd §§235, 236, 401, 1809 & 1809-e, V & T L",
    "lawSection": "Vehicle and Traffic Law",
    "memo": " \nBILL NUMBER: S8272\n\nSPONSOR: KENNEDY\n \nTITLE OF BILL:\n\nAn act to amend the vehicle and traffic law, in relation to making tech-\nnical corrections to such law\n\n \nPURPOSE OR GENERAL IDEA OF BILL:\n\nTo provide technical clean-up of the lettering and numbering of various\nprovisions of the Vehicle and Traffic Law added by separate chapters of\nthe laws of 2021.\n\n \nSUMMARY OF SPECIFIC PROVISIONS:\n\nSection 1 re-letters paragraph (g) of subdivision 1 of § 235 of the\nVehicle and Traffic Law, as added by Chapter 421 of the Laws of 2021, as\nparagraph (h).\n\nSection 2 re-letters paragraph (f) of subdivision 1 of § 236 of the\nVehicle and Traffic Law, as added by Chapter 421 of the Laws of 2021, as\nparagraph (g).\n\nSection 3 re-numbers subparagraph (vi) of paragraph (a) of subdivision\n5-a of § 401 of the Vehicle and Traffic Law, as added by Chapter 421 of\nthe Laws of 2021, as subparagraph (vii).\n\nSection 4 re-letters paragraph (f) of subdivision 1-a of § 1809 of the\nVehicle and Traffic Law, as added by Chapter 421 of the Laws of 2021, as\nparagraph (g).\n\nSection 5 renumbers subparagraph (vii) of paragraph (a) of subdivision 1\nof § 1809-e of the Vehicle and Traffic Law, as added by Chapter 421 of\nthe Laws of 2021, as subparagraph (viii).\n\n \nJUSTIFICATION:\n\nThe paragraphs and subparagraphs referenced in this bill were each sepa-\nrately added by two separate chapters of the laws of 2021 and, hence,\nthere are currently two separate versions of each letter and number laid\nout in the Vehicle and Traffic Law. Re-lettering and renumbering the\nenumerated paragraphs and subparagraphs will ensure clarity in the\nreferences to, and citations of, such provisions of law.\n\n \nPRIOR LEGISLATIVE HISTORY:\n\nNew bill.\n\n \nFISCAL IMPLICATIONS FOR STATE AND LOCAL GOVERNMENTS:\n\nNone.\n\n \nEFFECTIVE DATE:\nThis act shall take effect immediately.\n",
